// Test: Type cast expression
// Spec: 17-JORMUNGANDR-BOOTSTRAP.md § Type Casting
// Priority: P0 - Bootstrap Critical
//
// Purpose:
// Validate type casts generate correct C.
//
// Expected behavior:
// Should print 42 (as f64)

rite main() {
    ≔ x: !i32 = 42;
    ≔ y: !f64 = x as f64;
    println(y);
}
